WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.591 --> 00:00:03.259
&gt;&gt; Laura: WELL, IT'S FRIDAY, AND

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:07.730
THAT MEANS IT'S TIME FOR FRIDAY

00:00:07.731 --> 00:00:08.965
FOLLIES.

00:00:08.966 --> 00:00:10.733
TONIGHT'S THEME -- INTERRUPTING

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:11.434
BUSINESS AS USUAL.

00:00:11.435 --> 00:00:15.238
JOINING US NOW WITH ALL THE

00:00:15.239 --> 00:00:18.441
DETAILS, RAYMOND ARROYO,

00:00:18.442 --> 00:00:22.378
BEST-SELLING AUTHOR OF THE

00:00:22.379 --> 00:00:23.947
BRAND-NEW BOOK.

00:00:23.948 --> 00:00:26.716
THERE WERE A FEW HIGH-PROFILE

00:00:26.717 --> 00:00:28.418
EXAMPLES OF REPORTERS GETTING

00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:32.655
MORE THAN THEY BARGAINED FOR IN

00:00:32.656 --> 00:00:33.590
THE FIELD.

00:00:33.591 --> 00:00:37.260
&gt;&gt; AT THE CANADIAN BROADCASTING

00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:39.462
CORPORATION, A REPORTER WAS LIVE

00:00:39.463 --> 00:00:45.068
AT A COMEDY CLUB WHEN ACTOR BOYD

00:00:45.069 --> 00:00:46.503
BANKS APPROACHED.

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:46.903
WATCH.

00:00:46.904 --> 00:00:48.771
&gt;&gt; THEY'RE HOPING THIS TOWN HALL

00:00:48.772 --> 00:00:50.707
WILL STOP THIS TRANSITION, BUT

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:53.176
THINGS ARE GETTING A LITTLE

00:00:53.177 --> 00:00:55.345
AWKWARD OUT HERE, SO I'M GOING

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.613
TO PASS IT BACK TO YOU.

00:00:56.614 --> 00:00:57.747
&gt;&gt; WHAT A JERK.

00:00:57.748 --> 00:00:59.382
HE NIBBLED ON HIS EAR.

00:00:59.383 --> 00:01:04.320
HE NOW HAS COME OUT WITH A

00:01:04.321 --> 00:01:04.821
STATEMENT.

00:01:04.822 --> 00:01:05.622
&gt;&gt; Laura: CAN'T YOU IMMEDIATELY

00:01:05.623 --> 00:01:06.823
DEFEND YOURSELF.

00:01:06.824 --> 00:01:08.291
&gt;&gt; I WOULD THINK YOU CAN POP

00:01:08.292 --> 00:01:09.792
THIS GUY IN THE MOUTH.

00:01:09.793 --> 00:01:13.630
HE SAID HE NEEDS TREATMENT FOR

00:01:13.631 --> 00:01:15.765
HIS MENTAL HEALTH ISSUES.

00:01:15.766 --> 00:01:18.601
THIS HAPPENS FOR MORE FREQUENTLY

00:01:18.602 --> 00:01:20.970
THAN PEOPLE ARE AWARE.

00:01:20.971 --> 00:01:22.705
HE CLAIM THAT IS HE'S GUILTY FOR

00:01:22.706 --> 00:01:25.041
EVERYTHING AND, LIKE SMOLLETT,

00:01:25.042 --> 00:01:26.910
HE HAS MENTAL HEALTH ISSUES.

00:01:26.911 --> 00:01:29.746
THAT'S THE CONVENIENT GO-TO.

00:01:29.747 --> 00:01:32.348
&gt;&gt; Laura: BASIC MANNERS ISSUES.

00:01:32.349 --> 00:01:36.219
&gt;&gt; SOME PICKED UP THINGS THEY

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.453
NEVER INTEND.

00:01:37.454 --> 00:01:40.156
HE WAS POSTED OUTSIDE THE COHEN

00:01:40.157 --> 00:01:42.559
HEARING ROOM AND AN UNAWARE

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.460
YOUNG MAN DIDN'T KNOW HE WAS

00:01:44.461 --> 00:01:45.495
LIVE ON TV.

00:01:45.496 --> 00:01:46.863
&gt;&gt; ACTUALLY WINNING THE JOB.

00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:49.032
AND YOU CAN SIT THERE AND SAY,

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:51.568
YEAH, BUT THIS IS AN UNCREDIBLE

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:52.902
WITNESS BECAUSE HE HAD BEEN

00:01:52.903 --> 00:01:56.372
SAYING ONE THING JUST A FEW

00:01:56.373 --> 00:01:57.040
MONTHS AGO.

00:01:57.041 --> 00:01:57.540
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:57.541 --> 00:01:59.809
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOSH.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.212
&gt;&gt; Laura: I CAN HEAR A FRIEND OF

00:02:02.213 --> 00:02:04.247
MINE SAYING, AMERICANS EAT IN

00:02:04.248 --> 00:02:04.981
PUBLIC LIKE THIS.

00:02:04.982 --> 00:02:06.115
&gt;&gt; AWFUL, AWFUL.

00:02:06.116 --> 00:02:08.885
BUT, LAURA, SADLY, TOO MANY

00:02:08.886 --> 00:02:12.922
PEOPLE THINK THAT REPORTERS ARE

00:02:12.923 --> 00:02:13.323
PLAYTHINGS.

00:02:13.324 --> 00:02:14.857
THEY SEE THEM ON TV.

00:02:14.858 --> 00:02:16.893
SO THEY EITHER RELAX AROUND THEM

00:02:16.894 --> 00:02:20.597
OR THINK THEY CAN DO THESE SILLY

00:02:20.598 --> 00:02:20.930
THINGS.

00:02:20.931 --> 00:02:23.299
MY HERO WHEN IT COMES TO HAZING

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.535
IN THE FIELD AND DEALING WITH

00:02:25.536 --> 00:02:30.340
THIS IS OUR OWN MIKE TOBIN.

00:02:30.341 --> 00:02:35.979
&gt;&gt; TEN SECONDS LATER, THE SECOND

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:36.946
EXPLOSION GOES OFF.

00:02:36.947 --> 00:02:38.648
PLEASE DON'T DO THAT.

00:02:38.649 --> 00:02:41.484
WHERE HE DROPPED HIS KNAPSACK.

00:02:41.485 --> 00:02:41.884
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:41.885 --> 00:02:44.787
&gt;&gt; I LOVE THE DOUBLE HAND.

00:02:44.788 --> 00:02:47.023
PLEASE DON'T DO THAT, WITHOUT

00:02:47.024 --> 00:02:48.024
MISSING A BEAT.

00:02:48.025 --> 00:02:49.659
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE'S STRONG.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:50.960
IF ANYONE COMES UP YOU AND

00:02:50.961 --> 00:02:55.531
TOUCHES YOU, YOU CAN DO A QUICK

00:02:55.532 --> 00:02:55.832
ELBOW.

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:56.599
&gt;&gt; ONCE THEY TOUCH YOU.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:00.136
&gt;&gt; Laura: NO, NO, NO.

00:03:00.137 --> 00:03:02.605
&gt;&gt; JENNIFER LAWRENCE STARS IN A

00:03:02.606 --> 00:03:06.242
NEW FILM CALLED "UNBREAKING

00:03:06.243 --> 00:03:06.609
AMERICA."

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.444
IT IS A CELEBRITY PSA THAT IS

00:03:08.445 --> 00:03:11.681
SUPPOSED TO ACQUAINT THE

00:03:11.682 --> 00:03:13.082
AUDIENCE WITH THE CORRUPTION IN

00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:15.585
THE GOVERNMENT AND WHAT CAN WE

00:03:15.586 --> 00:03:16.019
DO ABOUT IT.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:18.788
&gt;&gt; HOW DO WE UNRIG THIS SYSTEM?

00:03:18.789 --> 00:03:23.293
I'M OBSESSED WITH THIS IDEA.

00:03:23.294 --> 00:03:26.162
NEARLY HALF OF AMERICAN VOTERS

00:03:26.163 --> 00:03:28.097
ARE REGISTERED AS INDEPENDENTS.

00:03:28.098 --> 00:03:31.501
BUT IT ALL ADDS UP TO THIS VAST

00:03:31.502 --> 00:03:32.902
RING OF INFLUENCE OVER OUR

00:03:32.903 --> 00:03:33.803
ELECTED LEADERS.

00:03:33.804 --> 00:03:35.605
IT'S A CORRUPT SYSTEM IN WHICH

00:03:35.606 --> 00:03:44.347
WE THE PEOPLE HAVE NEAR ZERO

00:03:44.348 --> 00:03:45.081
INFLUENCE OVER OUR GOVERNMENT.

00:03:45.082 --> 00:03:46.049
THAT IS SAD.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.183
THAT IS NOT THE COUNTRY I FEEL

00:03:47.184 --> 00:03:49.719
LIKE I GREW UP IN.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.187
&gt;&gt; WHAT COUNTRY DO YOU THINK YOU

00:03:51.188 --> 00:03:52.221
GREW UP?

00:03:52.222 --> 00:03:55.758
&gt;&gt; Laura: SHE'S ONLY 28 YEARS

00:03:55.759 --> 00:03:57.994
OLD.

00:03:57.995 --> 00:04:02.799
WATERGATE WAS IN THE '70S.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:07.570
&gt;&gt; SHE'S ADVOCATING AN

00:04:07.571 --> 00:04:08.404
ANTI-CORRUPTION BILL.

00:04:08.405 --> 00:04:10.540
THEY WANT AUTOMATIC VOTER

00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:13.843
REGISTRATION AND AT-HOME VOTING.

00:04:13.844 --> 00:04:16.713
AND THEY WOULD LIKE TO OVERTHROW

00:04:16.714 --> 00:04:20.583
THE ELECTORAL COLLEGE.

00:04:20.584 --> 00:04:23.686
THE CORRUPTION ACT IS ACTUALLY

00:04:23.687 --> 00:04:25.288
IN ITSELF A CORRUPTION.

00:04:25.289 --> 00:04:29.426
&gt;&gt; Laura: SHE SAID THERE'S A

